      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n## Chatterbox TTS (prosody)\n\nExpressive text-to-speech with an emotion/prosody control.\n\n- **exaggeration** (0.25-2.0): emotional intensity / prosody.\n- **cfg_weight** (0.2-1.0): pace / guidance.\n- **temperature**: sampling randomness.\n\n**Optional voice cloning:** unmute the `Load Audio` node, upload a\n5-10 s clean voice clip, and connect it to `audio_prompt`.\n\nModels auto-download to `models/chatterbox/`. Driven by\n`generate_speech.py --model chatterbox` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n## Chatterbox TTS (prosody)\n\nExpressive text-to-speech with an emotion/prosody control.\n\n- **exaggeration** (0.25-2.0): emotional intensity / prosody.\n- **cfg_weight** (0.2-1.0): pace / guidance.\n- **temperature**: sampling randomness.\n\n**Optional voice cloning:** unmute the `Load Audio` node, upload a\n5-10 s clean voice clip, and connect it to `audio_prompt`.\n\nModels auto-download to `models/chatterbox/`. Driven by\n`generate_speech.py --model chatterbox` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
